WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.626 --> 00:00:05.876
NAMOR
My ancestors would often say...

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:12.250
...only the most broken people,
can be great leaders.

00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:14.334
[Chanting]

00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:16.042
CROWD
[Chanting]

00:00:16.918 --> 00:00:18.417
RYAN COOGLER
Introducing Namor was really

00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:21.959
an opportunity to introduce another
sovereign ruler of a group of people.

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:24.250
He shows up representing Talokan.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:27.250
SHURI
He's coming for the surface world.

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.459
NATE MOORE
In Marvel publishing,

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:30.417
Namor was one of the
first Super Heroes, frankly.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.167
M'BAKU
They called him, K'uk'ulkan.

00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:34.959
The Feather Serpent God.

00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:38.125
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
Namor loves his people

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:42.125
and he's gonna protect them,
because to be a ruler

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:44.000
you have to serve the people.

00:00:44.042 --> 00:00:46.250
TaloKan has a deep meaning for me.

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.667
It's part of my personal heritage

00:00:48.751 --> 00:00:52.751
as a Mexican, as an inhabitant
of Mesoamerica.

00:00:52.792 --> 00:00:58.459
Finally, I could find a more powerful
representation of my culture,

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.000
with dignity and respect.

00:01:01.042 --> 00:01:03.250
LETITIA WRIGHT
I cannot wait for everyone to see Talokan.

00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:08.042
I'm excited about how we're gonna
see the world come alive.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.584
Both nations want the same
thing, which is to preserve

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:15.667
and to protect their people, but they're
willing to go about it different ways.

00:01:15.751 --> 00:01:17.792
NAMOR
I need to know if Wakanda

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:19.834
is an ally or an enemy.

00:01:19.918 --> 00:01:21.834
ANGELA BASSETT
Namor is very much concerned

00:01:21.918 --> 00:01:23.751
with what he needs
and what he wants.

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:26.042
This delicate dance
between the two of them,

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:28.250
I get chills just thinking about it.

00:01:29.876 --> 00:01:31.417
RAMONDA
Who are you?

00:01:31.459 --> 00:01:33.459
♪♪

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:36.876
NAMOR
My enemies call me Namor.

